<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
  <p>Every flush adds a row per counter, so the history is read only when asked for.</p>
  <button type="button" data-next-fetch class="rounded-md border border-border bg-background px-3 py-1 text-foreground hover:bg-accent">Show the flush history</button>
</div>
